rding: <a href='#task=3.3&amp;case=3.3-00529&amp;file=stage2_template%2FTASK.md'>stage2_template/TASK.md</a></p></td></tr><tr><th>Output</th><td><strong>Complete repaired RTL module.</strong></td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>Read input: stage2_template/design.v · <a href='#task=3.3&amp;case=3.3-00529&amp;file=stage2_template%2Fdesign.v'>Open raw</a></summary><pre>module filtersIP_0(\n  input clk,\n  output done,\n  input [1:0]filt_select,\n  output [15:0]result,\n  input rstn,\n  input start,\n  input [15:0]val\n);\n  // Filters IP dummy implementation\n  assign done = 1&#x27;b0;\n  assign result = ~(16&#x27;h0000);\nendmodule</pre></details></div></div><div class=\"flow\"><strong>Stage 1 output → abstraction gate → fresh Stage 2 input.</strong> The intermediate text is generated separately for each model/attempt. It is not a prefilled golden description. Stage 2 receives neither the clean RTL nor the Stage 1 conversation.</div><h2>Private final evaluation</h2><div class=\"card\"><table><tbody><tr><th style=\"width:175px\">Reference RTL</th><td><a href='#task=3.3&amp;case=3.3-00529&amp;file=private%2Fgolden.v'>private/golden.v</a></td></tr><tr><th style=\"width:175px\">Score / oracle</th><td>Binary formal equivalence to the hidden clean module</td></tr></tbody></table><p class=\"muted\">The formal oracle consumes the complete Stage 2 RTL file and compares it with the clean reference. A golden RTL file is scoring material, not a generated Stage 1 output.</p></div>"}, "files": [{"name": "case.json", "url": "assets/5476c520284a6cdf9809eb406eb6e948e845b30251461be3d12885c37e87c63a.txt", "size": 4496, "binary": false, "section": "Other: case.json"}, {"name": "private/equivalence.ys", "url": "assets/f86ff63ad3b3f21cba1bd8154400cbfd6291c853372de2ca5ba7e056c7a44586.txt", "size": 607, "binary": false, "section": "Private reference and oracle"}, {"name": "private/golden.v", "url": "assets/1e25d379aa35a8eb7c57f0f8ad41b830b0f6d1acfcaf7e324214a8133708d0ad.txt", "size": 